@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+<div>
+  Records every step executed inside the block to an execution tape (<code>mode: 'record'</code>),
+  or validates every step against a previously recorded tape and replays the recorded outcomes
+  without executing side effects (<code>mode: 'verify'</code>). Any divergence aborts the build.
+</div>
